  "title": "Vizsla Silver Announces Pricing Of US $250 Million Convertible Senior Notes Offering - Vizsla Silver Corp.",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia (November 19, 2025) – Vizsla Silver Corp. (TSX: VZLA) (NYSE: VZLA) (Frankfurt: 0G3) (“Vizsla Silver” or the “Company”)announces that it has priced its previously announced offering of convertible senior unsecured notes due 2031 (the “Notes”) in an aggregate principal amount of US$250 million (the “Offering”). The Offering is expected to close, subject to customary closing conditions, on […]",
